<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2014/Behind-Aldie-Mill.jpg" alt="A plein air painting of white houses and trees." width="450" height="551" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Behind Aldie Mill. 10x8, oil on linen panel. 2014</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I found a nice view behind the old mill in Aldie quite by accident as I was walking around taking a few reference photos. &nbsp;I painted this by the side of a small rill, huddled close to an old tree for shade, and if I moved just a few feet to either side the scene changed completely.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I did most of the painting on location and filled in some of the greens back in the studio.</p>